---
description: Prevent polished but inconsistent lab generation
alwaysApply: true
---

Before finalizing any lab or guide, perform a consistency audit:

- Check that code types match the platform contract described in the text.
- Check that Terraform resource settings match the described runtime behavior.
- Check that URLs, stages, routes, permissions, and payload formats are mutually consistent.
- Check that cleanup instructions match actual resource ownership.
- Check that all "expected result" examples are achievable from the provided code and IaC.

If any inconsistency is found:
- fix it before finalizing
- do not hide the inconsistency with vague wording
- do not keep multiple contradictory variants in one lab